@startuml sd06_last_report
!include ../style.iuml
autonumber

actor Programmer as P
participant "Main window\n(QML)" as QML
participant "LastReportDialog\n(QML)" as Report
participant "TrackControllerState" as State
participant "views" as Views

P -> QML : **View** on the CTC uplink strip
QML -> Report : open()
Report -> State : reportReadyText, report rows
State -> Views : report_rows(wayside)
Views --> State : one row per block: occupancy,\nswitch, signal, crossing
State --> Report : values from the last refresh
Report --> P : wayside ready (or why not)\nand every block as the\nCTC Office received it
P -> Report : **Close**
@enduml
